errors:
Invalid `prisma.provider.upsert()` invocation:

{
  where: {
    name_location: {
      name: "Ghestrat",
+     location: String
    }
  },
  create: {
    name: "Ghestrat",
    type: "csv",
    location: undefined
  },
  update: {
    type: "csv",
    location: undefined
  }
}

Argument `location` must not be null.
